mpus Venues - Office of Student Activities and Greek Life","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Event use may require advance scheduling; ordinary outdoor access can change with weather or campus operations.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gettysburg-musselman-library-room-006","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Musselman Library Room 006","title":"Book the Library’s Semi-Private Room","subtitle":"A reservable lower-level room for solo or group work","notes":"Reserve up to seven days ahead for a focused session, keeping the booking within the library’s two-hour daily limit per person or group.","short_summary":"Room 006 gives Gettysburg students a defined semi-private setting for individual concentration or group collaboration.","evidence_claim":"Musselman Library identifies lower-level Room 006 as a semi-private reservable study room for individual or group use, bookable for up to two hours per day and seven days in advance.","source_url":"https://www.gettysburg.edu/musselman-library/services/reserve-a-library-space","source_title":"Reserve A Library Space - Gettysburg College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Reservations are limited to Gettysburg College community members and may be made up to seven days ahead.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gettysburg-schmucker-art-gallery","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Schmucker Art Gallery","title":"Use Art to Start a Conversation","subtitle":"The Main Gallery and Project Space inside Schmucker Hall","notes":"Pair a gallery visit with a class discussion or student-group conversation, and check the official page for the current exhibition schedule.","short_summary":"Schmucker Art Gallery is a shared cultural space for exhibitions, talks, student work, and cross-disciplinary discussion.","evidence_claim":"Gettysburg College says Schmucker Art Gallery welcomes the campus community through exhibitions and programming and encourages students to use the space for discussions and interdisciplinary connections.","source_url":"https://www.gettysburg.edu/offices/schmucker-art-gallery/about/","source_title":"About Schmucker Art Gallery","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The gallery is on Schmucker Hall’s main floor; consult its official page for current exhibitions and posted hours.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gettysburg-jaeger-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"John F. Jaeger Center for Athletics, Recreation, and Fitness","title":"Try Recreation Beyond the Weight Room","subtitle":"A student recreation complex with fitness and climbing facilities","notes":"Review Campus Recreation offerings before visiting, then choose among fitness classes, bouldering, climbing, swimming, or intramurals.","short_summary":"The Jaeger Center brings multiple forms of student recreation and group wellness programming under one roof.","evidence_claim":"Gettysburg College documents that the Jaeger Center includes a fitness center, bouldering area, 30-foot climbing tower, multipurpose fitness room, gym, natatorium, and athletic-training facilities.","source_url":"https://www.gettysburg.edu/accepted-students/glossary","source_title":"Gettysburg Glossary","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Facility participation is governed by Campus Recreation eligibility, current schedules, and activity-specific safety rules.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings